#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:16
msgid "1. Visual Theme & Atmosphere"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:18
msgid ""
"Raycast's marketing site feels like the dark interior of a precision "
"instrument — a Swiss watch case carved from obsidian. The background "
"isn't just dark, it's an almost-black blue-tint (`#07080a`) that creates "
"a sense of being inside a macOS native application rather than a website."
" Every surface, every border, every shadow is calibrated to evoke the "
"feeling of a high-performance desktop utility: fast, minimal, "
"trustworthy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:20
msgid ""
"The signature move is the layered shadow system borrowed from macOS "
"window chrome: multi-layer box-shadows with inset highlights that "
"simulate physical depth, as if cards and buttons are actual pressed or "
"raised glass elements on a dark desk. Combined with Raycast Red "
"(`#FF6363`) — deployed almost exclusively in the hero's iconic diagonal "
"stripe pattern — the palette creates a brand that reads as \"powerful "
"tool with personality.\" The red doesn't dominate; it punctuates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:22
msgid ""
"Inter is used everywhere — headings, body, buttons, captions — with "
"extensive OpenType features (`calt`, `kern`, `liga`, `ss03`) creating a "
"consistent, readable typographic voice. The positive letter-spacing "
"(0.2px–0.4px on body text) is unusual for a dark UI and gives the text an"
" airy, breathable quality that counterbalances the dense, dark surfaces. "
"GeistMono appears for code elements, reinforcing the developer-tool "
"identity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:24
msgid "**Key Characteristics:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:25
msgid ""
"Near-black blue-tinted background (`#07080a`) — not pure black, subtly "
"blue-shifted"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:26
msgid ""
"macOS-native shadow system with multi-layer inset highlights simulating "
"physical depth"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:27
msgid ""
"Raycast Red (`#FF6363`) as a punctuation color — hero stripes, not "
"pervasive"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:28
msgid ""
"Inter with positive letter-spacing (0.2px) for an airy, readable dark-"
"mode experience"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:29
msgid "Radix UI component primitives powering the interaction layer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:30
msgid ""
"Subtle rgba white borders (0.06–0.1 opacity) for containment on dark "
"surfaces"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:31
msgid "Keyboard shortcut styling with gradient key caps and heavy shadows"
msgstr ""

