"201, 175, 0.05) 0px 0px 20px 5px`) behind hero elements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:123
msgid ""
"**Hover**: Cards brighten slightly via border opacity increase or subtle "
"shadow enhancement"
msgstr ""

