#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:193
msgid "Shadow Philosophy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:194
msgid ""
"Raycast's shadow system is the most macOS-native on the web. Multi-layer "
"shadows combine:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:195
msgid "**Outer rings** for containment (replacing traditional borders)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:196
msgid ""
"**Inset top highlights** (`rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05–0.25)`) simulating "
"light source from above"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:197
msgid "**Inset bottom darks** (`rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2)`) simulating shadow underneath"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:198
msgid ""
"The effect is physical: elements feel like glass or brushed metal, not "
"flat rectangles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:200
msgid "Decorative Depth"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:201
msgid ""
"**Warm glow**: `rgba(215, 201, 175, 0.05) 0px 0px 20px 5px` behind "
"featured elements — a subtle warm aura on the cold dark canvas"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:202
msgid ""
"**Blue info glow**: `rgba(0, 153, 255, 0.15)` for interactive state "
"emphasis"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:203
msgid ""
"**Red danger glow**: `rgba(255, 99, 99, 0.15)` for error/destructive "
"state emphasis"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:205
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:207
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:208
msgid ""
"Use `#07080a` (not pure black) as the background — the blue-cold tint is "
"essential to the Raycast feel"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:209
msgid ""
"Apply positive letter-spacing (+0.2px) on body text — this is "
"deliberately different from most dark UIs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:210
msgid ""
"Use multi-layer shadows with inset highlights for interactive elements — "
"the macOS-native depth is signature"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:211
msgid ""
"Keep Raycast Red (`#FF6363`) as punctuation, not pervasive — reserve it "
"for hero moments and error states"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:212
msgid ""
"Use `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06)` borders for card containment — barely "
"visible, structurally essential"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:213
msgid ""
"Apply weight 500 as the body text baseline — medium weight improves dark-"
"mode legibility"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:214
msgid ""
"Use pill shapes (86px+ radius) for primary CTAs, rectangular shapes "
"(6px–8px) for secondary actions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:215
msgid "Enable OpenType features `calt`, `kern`, `liga`, `ss03` on all Inter text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:216
msgid ""
"Use opacity transitions (hover: opacity 0.6) for button interactions, not"
" color changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:218
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:219
msgid ""
"Use pure black (`#000000`) as the background — the blue tint "
"differentiates Raycast from generic dark themes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:220
msgid ""
"Apply negative letter-spacing on body text — Raycast deliberately uses "
"positive spacing for readability"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:221
msgid ""
"Use Raycast Blue as the primary accent for everything — blue is for "
"interactive/info, red is the brand color"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:222
msgid ""
"Create single-layer flat shadows — the multi-layer inset system is core "
"to the macOS-native aesthetic"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:223
msgid ""
"Use regular weight (400) for body text when 500 is available — the extra "
"weight prevents dark-mode text from feeling thin"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:224
msgid ""
"Mix warm and cool borders — stick to the cool gray (`hsl(195, 5%, 15%)`) "
"border palette"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:225
msgid ""
"Apply heavy drop shadows without inset companions — shadows always come "
"in pairs (outer + inset)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_raycast.md:226
msgid ""
"Use decorative elements, gradients, or colorful backgrounds — the dark "
"void is the stage, content is the performer"
msgstr ""

